                "fallback": "From heycar to Joybuy for a new chapter in ecommerce ! :rocket:  After 2 enriching years as CMO at heycar, I am thrilled to announce my next adventure : joining JD.COM as Head of Marketing France to launch… | Thibault Delebarre | 10 comments",
                "text": "From heycar to Joybuy for a new chapter in ecommerce ! :rocket:\n\nAfter 2 enriching years as CMO at heycar, I am thrilled to announce my next adventure : joining <http:\/\/JD.COM|JD.COM> as Head of Marketing France to launch Joybuy, a new ecommerce platform set to rival Amazon.\n\nIn China, <http:\/\/JD.COM|JD.COM> redefined ecommerce with :\n&gt;&gt; End-to-end supply chain control through JINGDONG Logistics, enabling ultra-fast delivery\n&gt;&gt; Only high-quality products selection from trusted international and local brands \n\nNow, we are bringing that same ambition to Europe, already offering same-day delivery in Paris region.\n\nI am convinced that Joybuy will bring real value to French customers. If you share this vision and want to be part of the journey, I am building my team with 10+ open roles: Brand &amp; Offline, Social Media, Paid Acquisition, UX, Deals &amp; Promotions, PR, design, and more.\n\nApply directly on <http:\/\/JD.com|JD.com>'s career website (link in comment) or reach out to me. | 10 comments on LinkedIn",
